error[NK1102]: `Wide::from_halves` expects `low` to be `u64`, but you're passing `i64`.
  --> tests/wide_takes_the_low_half_unsigned.nika:6:2
   |
 6 | 	let w = Wide::from_halves(low, high)
   |  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: The low half of a `Wide[i64]` is held in the unsigned type of its width, `u64`, as `widening_mul` hands it back (Part I 2.2).
   = help: Pass the low half as a `u64`.
1 type error
